terables` at module level\n- Register only needed controllers (LineController, BarController, etc.)\n- Destroy chart on unmount\n- Use `src/index.css` tokens for colors\n\n---\n\n## The Mandate\n\nDesign a comprehensive solution for the DeskFlow dashboard card system that:\n\n1. **Removes all bespoke borders** from every dashboard card per `design/design.md` §4\n2. **Uses shadcn `Card`** (`@shadcn/card`) as the base component — NOT hand-written div markup\n3. **Uses shadcn `Button`** (`@shadcn/button`) for all interactive elements — with `whileTap` from `motion/react`\n4. **Uses `motion/react`** exclusively — no `framer-motion` imports anywhere in dashboard code\n5. **Integrates `@kokonutui/apple-activity-card`** — the activity rings component into the dashboard\n6. **Integrates `@kokonutui/bento-grid`** — the bento grid layout into the dashboard\n7. **Fixes stopwatch tracking** — `get-current-foreground` handler returns `{ app: '', isReal: false }` not null\n8. **Fixes StatusBand height** — increase `minHeight` from 140px to 220px\n9. **Uses `chart.js`** for productivity chart instead of hand-written bars\n\n---\n\n## Requirement Checklist\n\n### Data Processing\n- Verify `get-current-foreground` handler in `src/main.ts` returns `{ app: '', isReal: false }` when `useJson` is true\n- Verify frontend guards check `data.isReal` not `data.app`\n\n### Visual Specifications\n- All dashboard cards use `@shadcn/card` with LAMINAR re-skinning: `bg-zinc-900/80 backdrop-blur-xl`, NO `border`, NO `shadow-sm`, `rounded-xl`\n- All buttons use `@shadcn/button` with `variant=\"ghost\"` or `variant=\"default\"` as appropriate\n- `motion/react` for all animations: `whileTap={scale: 0.96}` for button feedback\n- `@kokonutui/apple-activity-card` integrated with proper `title` prop and dark mode\n- `@kokonutui/bento-grid` integrated as dashboard layout\n- StatusBand minHeight: 220px\n- Productivity chart uses `chart.js` (Bar chart)\n- No decorative gradients, neon glow, glass chrome, spring/bounce\n- Colors: zinc-950/900/800 palette, pink-500 signal hue only\n- Fonts: Inter + JetBrains Mono + Space Grotesk (max 2 per view)\n\n### UX Flow\n- Deep Focus card: Card header with title + Badge, CardContent with circular progress + timer controls, CardFooter with disclaimer\n- Mode toggle (Timer/Challenge): two Button components side by side\n- Preset buttons: three Button components in a row\n- Start/End buttons: primary Button with icon + label\n- All buttons use `whileTap` from `motion/react` for micro-interaction feedback\n- AnimatePresence for mode transitions\n\n### Constraints\n- Must use `@shadcn/card` and `@shadcn/button` — NOT hand-written div markup\n- Must use `motion/react` — NOT `framer-motion`\n- Must re-skin to `src/index.css` tokens — NOT foreign palettes\n- `rounded-xl` maximum, `p-5` maximum padding\n- Dark mode only\n- `prefers-reduced-motion` honored\n- One motion engine per element — never mix `motion/react` with `framer-motion`\n- `@kokonutui/apple-activity-card` and `@kokonutui/bento-grid` must be used in the dashboard layout\n- `chart.js` must be used for the productivity chart\n\n---\n\n## MCP Component Inventory (ACTUAL verified names)\n\n### shadcn MCP (`@shadcn`) — 61 components verified via `shadcn-ui-mcp_list_components`\n\n| Component | Source | Use for |\n|-----------|--------|---------|\n| `card` | `shadcn-ui-mcp_get_component(\"card\")` | Standard UI cards; `rounded-xl`, `ring-1 ring-foreground/10`, `bg-card`, `CardHeader`, `CardContent`, `CardFooter`, `CardTitle`, `CardDescription`, `CardAction` sub-components |\n| `button` | `shadcn-ui-mcp_get_component(\"button\")` | Buttons; `cva` variants: `default`, `destructive`, `outline`, `secondary`, `ghost`, `link`; sizes: `default`, `sm`, `lg`, `xs`, `icon`, `icon-xs`, `icon-sm`, `icon-lg` |\n| `badge` | `shadcn-search-items-in-registries(\"@shadcn\", \"badge\")` | Status indicators; `variant='default'|'secondary'` |\n| `hover-card` | shadcn registry | Hover cards |\n| `dia